{"data": [{"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-20T12:13:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112517677764022290"], "id": "2112517677764022290", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "之前看片喜欢看糖心vlog上面一个叫唐伯虎拍的视频，但是有段时间他一直不更新，紧接着我就在抖音上就刷到疑似是和他合作的女主直播连麦律师，然后说他已经被抓进去了，问自己会不会也跟着进去…不过现在貌似也没更新、、", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112517677764022290"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-20T11:36:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112508315465130337"], "id": "2112508315465130337", "lang": "art", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 444, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112500969502388336", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🥵🥵 https://t.co/9NM7WeLbtr", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112508315465130337"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-20T11:04:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112500276448174465"], "id": "2112500276448174465", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 760, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "好奇一个问题，男生发育期的时候长鸡鸡的时候会不会疼❓或者说会明显的感觉到鸡鸡在变大吗❓女生奶子发育的时候真的是会很明显的感觉到，会疼会肿感觉在慢慢变大、、", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112500276448174465"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-20T10:46:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112495702660321639"], "id": "2112495702660321639", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 2729, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "所以攒了几天的精液和攒了几个星期的会有不一样吗❓每次异地完和对象第一次做他射出来的都很浓很多，说是攒了好久的就是会这么多…", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112495702660321639"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-20T08:26:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112457614168903816", "2112460438277636467"], "id": "2112460438277636467", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7478, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 17, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "被有舌钉的人口感觉是啥样啊❓好好奇啊，会不会比被普通的舌头要更舒服啊…之前好像看过一个片是这样的，女主就是打了舌钉，而且感觉拿舌钉剐蹭马眼和冠状沟的系带很涩啊…", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112460438277636467"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-20T08:24:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112459922915148175"], "id": "2112459922915148175", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1314, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "所以人和动物的区别是不是就在于人能体会到来自性的快乐…或者说人做爱并只不是为了繁衍后代而是为了放松，体会性爱的愉悦。而大部分动物做爱只是底层繁育代码发力了，甚至很多动物做爱的时候并不会舒服而是会痛苦，比如母猫做爱的时候就一直在惨叫，因为公猫的鸡鸡上有倒刺。", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112459922915148175"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-20T08:19:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112458021813338150", "2112458565365711196"], "id": "2112458565365711196", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 7951, "like_count": 22, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 23, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "既然射多了的精液是不是会变得很稀很稀、、到最后就像透明的水一样了…那是不是精液中白色的粘稠物才是有精子的❓", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112458565365711196"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-20T08:07:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112455762438172797"], "id": "2112455762438172797", "lang": "ja", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 3044, "like_count": 167, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 38, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "路过可以摸一下 https://t.co/kTxC8bVlPm", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112455762438172797"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-20T08:00:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112453837424615581"], "id": "2112453837424615581", "lang": "art", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1166, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112452958797623695", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🥵🥵 https://t.co/QAIUKHZGLH", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112453837424615581"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-20T07:36:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112447977537356062"], "id": "2112447977537356062", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2033, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "面完一家基金的销售助理实习生\n带教真的符合我对金融男的刻板印象…压力感太强了妈呀 https://t.co/TbRiXCgL66", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112447977537356062"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-20T03:55:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112392334075936939"], "id": "2112392334075936939", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 56125, "like_count": 117, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 102, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "我很想知道安睡裤和成人纸尿裤的区别在哪❓为什么安睡裤一条这么贵，但是成人纸尿裤会便宜点，那我能不能直接用成人纸尿裤呢❓", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112392334075936939"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-20T03:35:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112387129456402658"], "id": "2112387129456402658", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 3095, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 18, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "妈的窒息了 这换做谁能承受得住、、\n我还要实习啊…🥲🥲 https://t.co/0QD2DcLmOE", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112387129456402658"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-20T03:12:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112381311621173692"], "id": "2112381311621173692", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 4111, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "听说色戒原本是不打算真法的，但是导演有恶趣味，再加上梁朝伟也想，所以梁朝伟和汤唯就真的做了，感觉和a片没区别了，梁朝伟蛋蛋都能看到，绝对是进去了…", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112381311621173692"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-20T03:09:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112380662401618156"], "id": "2112380662401618156", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 44398, "like_count": 243, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 138, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "说一个暴论：学历越高越性压抑\n\n你看那些在网上约炮约的最猛的就是硕博生了…", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112380662401618156"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-19T23:33:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112326197250281938"], "id": "2112326197250281938", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 5473, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "为什么现在没有每日大赛博主了，我记得之前都是直接在每日大赛的帖子下面看片的，都不需要自己找，特别方便啊…", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112326197250281938"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-19T23:11:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112320830252417143"], "id": "2112320830252417143", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2382, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我真的觉得一个人如果脸型和鼻子长得好看那么他就不会太丑，因为这两个地方想要动刀子都很遭罪…", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112320830252417143"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-19T23:08:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112320085943836961"], "id": "2112320085943836961", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 3580, "like_count": 28, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "那条内射难清理的帖子有人说用内功逼出来，我的妈呀，真的有这个内功感觉做爱的时候能把男生的唧唧夹断了…", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112320085943836961"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-19T22:05:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112296494351122879", "2112304060015731059"], "id": "2112304060015731059", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 3540, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "不行了我要笑死了 这个回复太好玩了\n再次给外国人带来一点来自中国的小震撼 https://t.co/ssJp7H5jKO", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112304060015731059"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:01:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112242642994307564"], "id": "2112242642994307564", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 3500, "like_count": 38, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "原来成为无聊的大人是这样的吗，每天都在焦虑实习焦虑毕业焦虑论文焦虑赚钱。也少不了和同龄人攀比，看到对方拿到了好公司的offer自己也会羡慕嫉妒，但是又觉得自己的能力实在不行。\n\n马上就23岁生日了，我还没想好今年要许什么愿望，据说对着生日蛋糕上燃烧的蜡烛闭眼许愿然后吹掉最灵了。", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112242642994307564"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-19T17:52:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112240610333933821"], "id": "2112240610333933821", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3971, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "崔秀彬是1还是0啊？为什么1的屁股也这么翘这么圆啊？一直以为只有0的屁股才会这样…", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112240610333933821"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-19T17:50:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112239910291997122"], "id": "2112239910291997122", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2666, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112226347116622302", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "家人们 你们觉得我这周能把数据清洗出来并且跑一个平行趋势检验&amp;基准回归吗、、真的力竭了，求显著🙏 https://t.co/MAIAqU7NTW", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112239910291997122"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-19T17:13:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112230760665288964"], "id": "2112230760665288964", "lang": "art", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 2365, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112165047724372123", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "🥵🥵 https://t.co/5eoCGdJYKp", "url": "https://x.com/wmtbxsh/status/2112230760665288964"}], "includes": {"tweets": [{"author_id": "1268774232411930624", "created_at": "2026-10-20T11:07:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112500969502388336"], "id": "2112500969502388336", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 566, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我今天好像……穿得有点性感。但是又被老板叫来办公室了 https://t.co/D5kFY3X50R"}, {"author_id": "1951349860910899201", "created_at": "2026-10-20T07:56:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112452958797623695"], "id": "2112452958797623695", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1907, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "实验室也有自己的乐高玩具，有要玩的嘛？嘿嘿😁  \n可不能被小老头发现了，不然又要挨训了。 https://t.co/5BW4mh0R43"}, {"author_id": "1223407990713114624", "created_at": "2026-10-19T16:56:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112226347116622302"], "id": "2112226347116622302", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4345, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "手动用excel函数处理了一晚上的数据还不如直接交给chat让他给我处理…"}, {"author_id": "1850556241644589056", "created_at": "2026-10-19T12:52:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112165047724372123"], "id": "2112165047724372123", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 259, "impression_count": 91467, "like_count": 1074, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 187, "retweet_count": 36}, "text": "跟年上谈恋爱挺幸福的，各方面都被照顾得很到位。\n\n有些地方满足不了，也不反对我自己想办法解决🫣 https://t.co/4Ng4O33MbW"}], "users": [{"id": "1223407990713114624", "name": "我明天不想说话", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2012531606020390912/jU4-9qGu_normal.jpg", "username": "wmtbxsh", "verified": false}